*** Settings ***
Documentation       Business actions with e-mails - these keywords are used in tests.
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/interactions/email_interactions.resource


*** Keywords ***
Connect To Mailbox
    [Documentation]    Logs in to the mailbox. Belongs in the test setup.
    Open Mailbox Connection

Disconnect From Mailbox
    [Documentation]    Logs out of the mailbox. Belongs in the test teardown.
    Close Mailbox Connection

Wait For Email From
    [Documentation]    Waits for an e-mail from the sender with the subject and returns it.
    [Arguments]    ${sender}    ${subject}
    ${email_id}    Wait For New Email    ${sender}    ${subject}
    RETURN    ${email_id}
